WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.934
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:04.837
LOGAN ROY: Ah!<i> Bon Dieu!</i>

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.774
Nice, right?
Good for the morale.

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:09.608
How's your morale?

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:10.943
♪ (MUSIC STOPS) ♪

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:12.645
-Great.
-LOGAN: Good.

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:15.514
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:18.951
JESSE ARMSTRONG:<i> In 203, they go
 on a hunting trip to Hungary.</i>

00:00:19.051 --> 00:00:20.253 line:0%
The centerpiece of the episode

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.889 line:0%
is this sort of
nightmarish dinner

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.223
<i> that Logan hosts.</i>

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:25.458
LOGAN: To our top team.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:29.228
ARMSTRONG:<i> I was lit-inspired
 by reading about Stalin</i>

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:33.066
would have these long dinner
drinking parties

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.368
where sometimes,
he would drink water

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.970
and get his commissars
and marshals

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.572
to drink alcohol and then,

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:41.941
he'd use their indiscretions
against them later.

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:43.442
-(TABLE GUESTS CLAMOR)
-Come on, everyone!

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:46.779
We're supposed to be having
a nice time. Drink!

00:00:47.079 --> 00:00:49.516
It had a flavor
of those dinner parties

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.351
and the humiliations
he'd mete out.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.420
-Tom!
-Yes?

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.353
Sit on the floor!

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.922
-Seriously?
-Yeah, it's a game.

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:58.357
-Boar on the floor.
-I really-- I feel--

00:00:58.558 --> 00:00:59.459
LOGAN: Get down!

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:03.329
The actual boar on the floor
just came from thinking about

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.965
the context they were in
and the sort of thing

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:07.166
that might occur to him.

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:09.201
Oink for your sausages, piggy.
Oink, oink!

00:01:09.301 --> 00:01:13.539
That feeling of a powerful man
unhinged.

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:15.841
Who spoke to Pencil?

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:19.012
Tom and Greg, a crucial moment
when Tom,

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:22.682
he maybe could
get some money in the bank

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:24.584
by selling him out, doesn't.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:28.688
LOGAN: Hey! Crawl in a circle
and close your eyes.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.089
-Greg, oink!
-(OINKING)

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.258
I don't think it's definitive
that it hasn't--

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:35.128
Tom hasn't changed
into a good guy.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:36.229
<i> It just seemed to us,</i>

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:37.897
<i>true people have different sides
 to them,</i>

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:42.135
and Tom, for whatever reason,
had enough regard for Greg

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:44.437
that he-- he didn't want to
do it in that moment.

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:47.340
-How was it?
-It was pretty, uh...

00:01:48.707 --> 00:01:49.675
pretty tough.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.778
Shiv and Tom, it's complicated.

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.012
How was your weekend?

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.114
-SHIV ROY: Me?
-Y-- yeah. Anything to report?

00:01:55.214 --> 00:01:56.949
Uh... yeah.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.485
He found out
on his wedding night

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.387
that she wasn't
really super keen

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:04.323
on a monogamous relationship
and that was tough.

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:07.160
-Do you wanna know?
-Maybe later.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:08.928
ARMSTRONG:<i> There is a bond
 in that relationship,</i>

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:12.164
I think, of like
sexual connection

00:02:12.264 --> 00:02:14.667
<i> and intellectual--
 and they have a bunch</i>

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.635
<i> of different ways that
 they do connect.</i>

00:02:16.735 --> 00:02:19.338
<i> And so, it's not
 a dead relationship,</i>

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.207
even if it's
a quite troubled one.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:22.809
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

